  _description: The FARMER side of the barn moral fork (victim + raid + payoff + reactions),
    Shape B (P1-8). Ephemeral - if the player ignores it for 4 windows it quietly lapses. Premise
    holds while the raider's competing pact is NOT sworn - committing to the raider
    (world.raider_offer_taken) contradicts it and the farmer arc retires failed/conflict, the
    mutual-exclusion mechanism. The opposing thread is raider_pact (premise grain_recovered ==
    false). Resolution is left empty (the payoff fork is AND-only until P3-5).
